<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείκνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mode of proof,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν σημείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1408a26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>APr.</u>
				34a4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>proof, specimen,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἀνδρείας παρέχεσθαι, δ. εὐνοίας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.15.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2.3.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>display, exhibition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Macho
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.245e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖξιν λόγων ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					3.98c
				</span></i>
			; anatomical <i>demonstration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.627
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>calling up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					2.4.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i>PMag. Leid.W.</i><i><span class="en">
				6.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>demonstrative force</i> or <i>reference,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.65
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				9.8
			</span></i>, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
